# 📚 Strings (Part 1) - Introduction & Fundamentals

## 📌 Introduction

A **String** is a sequence of characters used to represent text. Strings are one of the most commonly used data structures in programming and play an important role in problem-solving, competitive programming, and software development.

Unlike arrays that can store any data type, strings specifically store characters.

