# 4️⃣ Input & Output

### Using cin

```cpp
string name;

cin>>name;
```

Input

```text
Umangi
```

Output

```text
Umangi
```

---

### Problem with cin

```cpp
cin
```

reads only one word.

Example

Input

```text
Umangi Patel
```

Output

```text
Umangi
```

---

### Using getline()

```cpp
string name;

getline(cin,name);
```

Input

```text
